  "description": "Kodezi Chronos is a debugging-first language model that achieves state-of-the-art results on SWE-bench Lite (80.33%) and 67% real-world fix accuracy, over six times better than GPT-4. Built with Adaptive Graph-Guided Retrieval and Persistent Debug Memory. Model available Q1 2026 via Kodezi OS.",
